{"probe": 6, "url": "https://downloads.bbc.co.uk/learningenglish/features/6min/261008_6_minute_english_are_people_drinking_less_alcohol_download.mp3", "duration": 409.6, "info": {"version": 2, "ad_free": true, "coverage": 0.969, "repaired_blocks": 1, "preroll_runner": 0.0, "first_word_runner": 18.88, "last_word_runner": 387.1, "ad_gaps_runner": [], "content_duration": 409.602, "runner_duration": 409.602, "markers": []}, "seconds": 23.6, "n": 32, "median_abs": 0.15, "p90_abs": 123.92, "max_abs": 198.51, "over_1s": 4, "cues": [{"i": 0, "s": 18.88, "e": 19.61, "ctc": [18.16, 19.58], "d": 0.72, "t": "Hi Neil."}, {"i": 1, "s": 19.94, "e": 20.63, "ctc": [19.94, 20.44], "d": 0.0, "t": "Hi Georgie."}, {"i": 2, "s": 20.82, "e": 23.37, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "Do you want to hear something quite unusual for me?"}, {"i": 3, "s": 23.37, "e": 24.21, "ctc": [23.74, 24.22], "d": -0.37, "t": "Err, yes!"}, {"i": 4, "s": 24.7, "e": 28.07, "ctc": [24.84, 27.98], "d": -0.14, "t": "I haven't had an alcoholic drink this year."}, {"i": 5, "s": 28.07, "e": 28.91, "ctc": [28.7, 28.88], "d": -0.63, "t": "Wow!"}, {"i": 6, "s": 29.02, "e": 30.23, "ctc": [29.04, 30.56], "d": -0.02, "t": "That is really impressive."}, {"i": 7, "s": 30.7, "e": 31.33, "ctc": [30.66, 31.32], "d": 0.04, "t": "How do you feel?"}, {"i": 8, "s": 31.33, "e": 32.39, "ctc": [31.56, 32.3], "d": -0.23, "t": "Like a new person?"}, {"i": 9, "s": 32.94, "e": 35.11, "ctc": [33.0, 35.0], "d": -0.06, "t": "I do feel very good, I have to say."}, {"i": 10, "s": 35.34, "e": 40.29, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "I can't say the same – I did have a few alcoholic drinks at the weeken"}, {"i": 11, "s": 40.7, "e": 44.43, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "But in many parts of the world, people don't drink alcohol at all."}, {"i": 12, "s": 44.82, "e": 48.71, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "In the UK it's very common – that is until recently."}, {"i": 13, "s": 49.08, "e": 60.85, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "Today on 6 Minute English, we're going to find out why many people are"}, {"i": 14, "s": 62.3, "e": 63.05, "ctc": [260.81, 260.91], "d": -198.51, "t": "OK."}, {"i": 15, "s": 63.05, "e": 65.37, "ctc": [63.07, 65.33], "d": -0.02, "t": "Neil, let's start with a quiz question."}, {"i": 16, "s": 65.84, "e": 75.93, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "Many people in the UK and other countries choose to give up alcohol in"}, {"i": 17, "s": 76.4, "e": 83.23, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "Is it: a) No-drink New Year b) Alcohol-free January, or c) Dry January"}, {"i": 18, "s": 83.7, "e": 87.45, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "Well, I know the answer to this, but I'm not going to give it away."}, {"i": 19, "s": 87.68, "e": 88.11, "ctc": [260.81, 260.91], "d": -173.13, "t": "OK."}, {"i": 20, "s": 88.16, "e": 91.31, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "Well, then our listeners can find out the answer at the end of the pro"}, {"i": 21, "s": 91.62, "e": 92.37, "ctc": [90.62, 92.22], "d": 1.0, "t": "Yes, they can."}, {"i": 22, "s": 92.56, "e": 99.93, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "So, Georgie, I hear all the time that younger people don't drink as mu"}, {"i": 23, "s": 100.24, "e": 101.19, "ctc": [100.52, 101.18], "d": -0.28, "t": "Is that true?"}, {"i": 24, "s": 101.19, "e": 110.19, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "Well, in the UK, surveys suggest that 16 to 24-year-olds are more like"}, {"i": 25, "s": 110.68, "e": 111.11, "ctc": [260.81, 260.91], "d": -150.13, "t": "OK."}, {"i": 26, "s": 111.2, "e": 114.55, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "So, why are more young people choosing to be sober?"}, {"i": 27, "s": 115.14, "e": 116.65, "ctc": [115.08, 116.8], "d": 0.06, "t": "That means not to drink alcohol."}, {"i": 28, "s": 117.18, "e": 121.93, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "Well, the BBC World Service podcast What in the World have been invest"}, {"i": 29, "s": 122.34, "e": 129.61, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "Presenter Hannah Gelbart met three young people who choose to be sober"}, {"i": 30, "s": 129.62, "e": 131.03, "ctc": [129.96, 130.98], "d": -0.34, "t": "Here's Daniel's story:"}, {"i": 31, "s": 131.82, "e": 132.22, "ctc": [131.98, 132.08], "d": -0.16, "t": "Yeah."}, {"i": 32, "s": 132.22, "e": 141.41, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "So, today I don't drink at all, but when I was in my early 20s, I thin"}, {"i": 33, "s": 141.76, "e": 151.23, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "I think you'd probably get a few weird glances if you're like, \"Yeah, "}, {"i": 34, "s": 151.23, "e": 153.61, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "It's not necessarily something I want to do moving forward.\""}, {"i": 35, "s": 153.84, "e": 155.53, "ctc": [153.95, 155.51], "d": -0.11, "t": "So, how many years have you been sober for?"}, {"i": 36, "s": 155.74, "e": 158.13, "ctc": [156.21, 157.99], "d": -0.47, "t": "I would say it's been six years now."}, {"i": 37, "s": 158.13, "e": 158.797, "ctc": [158.15, 158.55], "d": -0.02, "t": "Six years?"}, {"i": 38, "s": 158.98, "e": 164.35, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "So, Daniel says that when he was younger, he felt societal pressure to"}, {"i": 39, "s": 164.98, "e": 170.81, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "Societal pressure is feeling like you need to do something because lot"}, {"i": 40, "s": 171.08, "e": 171.48, "ctc": [171.23, 171.45], "d": -0.15, "t": "Right."}, {"i": 41, "s": 171.56, "e": 175.79, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "So, Daniel says drinking was the norm at university and after work."}, {"i": 42, "s": 176.26, "e": 179.65, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "The norm is a way of saying that something is normal or common."}, {"i": 43, "s": 180.08, "e": 189.73, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "But during the Covid-19 pandemic, when people in the UK were unable to"}, {"i": 44, "s": 190.18, "e": 194.91, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "After that, he decided to be sober and he hasn't had a drink for about"}, {"i": 45, "s": 195.56, "e": 203.99, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "So, Georgie, it seems like many young people don't drink at all and lo"}, {"i": 46, "s": 204.38, "e": 207.51, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "But recently there's been a bit of a change, hasn't there?"}, {"i": 47, "s": 207.51, "e": 208.21, "ctc": [331.43, 331.65], "d": -123.92, "t": "Yes."}, {"i": 48, "s": 208.21, "e": 219.89, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "Whilst many people use social media to share their experience of drink"}, {"i": 49, "s": 220.46, "e": 226.71, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "They argue we're too worried about fitness and wellness, and that drin"}, {"i": 50, "s": 227.28, "e": 231.97, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "Here's Millie talking more about this to BBC World Service podcast Wha"}, {"i": 51, "s": 232.46, "e": 236.17, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "I think we had this, like, rise of self-optimisation content."}, {"i": 52, "s": 236.36, "e": 242.43, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "I think unfortunately sobriety, kind of, got swept in with that and it"}, {"i": 53, "s": 242.43, "e": 245.43, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "And, you know, for many of us, that's probably not our reality with no"}, {"i": 54, "s": 245.43, "e": 249.13, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "It's that we do it to feel a bit more sane or, you know, things like t"}, {"i": 55, "s": 249.16, "e": 254.81, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "And so, I think now we are entering this, like, almost pushback era of"}, {"i": 56, "s": 254.81, "e": 260.53, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "Like, it's not just alcohol – you're seeing more celebrities smoking a"}, {"i": 57, "s": 260.64, "e": 261.13, "ctc": [260.81, 260.91], "d": -0.17, "t": "OK."}, {"i": 58, "s": 261.22, "e": 271.43, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "So, Millie thinks that being sober is associated with certain kinds of"}, {"i": 59, "s": 271.43, "e": 277.79, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "Yes, and Millie says being sober gets touted as a way to get up at 5am"}, {"i": 60, "s": 278.56, "e": 282.71, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "In other words, people talk about it a lot and try to encourage people"}, {"i": 61, "s": 282.98, "e": 287.49, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "But Millie says that being sober isn't always about being super fit an"}, {"i": 62, "s": 287.94, "e": 289.85, "ctc": [287.86, 289.88], "d": 0.08, "t": "For her, it's about being sane."}, {"i": 63, "s": 290.44, "e": 295.21, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "But still, Millie thinks there's a pushback against self-optimisation "}, {"i": 64, "s": 295.58, "e": 301.07, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "Pushback means a criticism of the content, and people are pushing back"}, {"i": 65, "s": 301.54, "e": 305.41, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "For example, lots of celebrities post about themselves drinking and sm"}, {"i": 66, "s": 306.3, "e": 313.91, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "Well, Georgie, I've decided to try to give up alcohol for a whole year"}, {"i": 67, "s": 313.94, "e": 315.77, "ctc": [313.94, 315.78], "d": 0.0, "t": "It's really up to the individual."}, {"i": 68, "s": 316.02, "e": 319.01, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "Yeah, I still enjoy having a few drinks with my friends."}, {"i": 69, "s": 319.22, "e": 321.79, "ctc": [319.23, 321.57], "d": -0.01, "t": "I think it's just all about balance, really. OK."}, {"i": 70, "s": 321.79, "e": 325.29, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "Neil, it's time to reveal the answer to this week's question."}, {"i": 71, "s": 325.52, "e": 330.51, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "I asked, \"What was the name given for when people give up alcohol in J"}, {"i": 72, "s": 331.34, "e": 331.74, "ctc": [331.43, 331.65], "d": -0.09, "t": "Yes."}, {"i": 73, "s": 331.92, "e": 334.33, "ctc": [331.99, 334.37], "d": -0.07, "t": "And the answer is Dry January."}, {"i": 74, "s": 334.64, "e": 336.01, "ctc": [334.71, 335.93], "d": -0.07, "t": "That is correct. Well done!"}, {"i": 75, "s": 336.26, "e": 345.39, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "Let's recap the vocabulary we learned in this programme, starting with"}, {"i": 76, "s": 346.04, "e": 351.97, "ctc": null, "d": null, "t": "Societal pressure is the feeling that you should do something because "}, {"i": 77, "s": 351.97, "e": 356.67, 